    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.38,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "今年的三伏天从七月十一号开始到八月十九号结束，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0105,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0103,
        "sc_delta": 0.0003,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "今年的三伏天从七月十一号开始，到八月十九号结束。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.498,
      "end": 11.384,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "长达四十天的时间。三伏刚好是在小暑和大暑之间，",
      "score": 0.1088,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.012,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0132,
        "sc_delta": -0.0011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.238,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "长达四十天的时间，产妇可好是在小处和大处之间。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 11.481,
      "end": 14.179,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "是一年当中啊最热的时候。",
      "score": 0.0416,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0443,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0469,
        "sc_delta": -0.0026,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.091,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "是一年当中啊，最夜的时候。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 14.352,
      "end": 18.916,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "三伏时节高温闷热，暑湿之气盛虚而郁，",
      "score": 0.4147,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5343,
        "sc_logprob": -0.5503,
        "sc_delta": -0.016,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.578,
        "seg_cer": 0.25,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "三伏时节，高温闷热，初时之气，乘虚而入。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 19.221,
      "end": 26.615,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "易使人心火耗，稍微不注意，往往就会引发苦夏或者是中暑等等疾病。",
      "score": 0.1002,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0799,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0753,
        "sc_delta": 0.0045,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.004,
        "seg_cer": 0.214,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "一时用心亏耗，稍微不注意，往往就会引发口下或者是中暑等等疾病。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 26.799,
      "end": 30.349,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "要养生就要牢记这一份三字经，",
      "score": 0.0111,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0934,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1077,
        "sc_delta": -0.0143,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.021,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "要养生，就要牢记这一份《三字经》。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 30.349,
      "end": 34.46,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "那就轻松好多吧。吃山药、",
      "score": 0.6179,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6211,
        "sc_logprob": -0.6411,
        "sc_delta": -0.02,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.687,
        "seg_cer": 0.3,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "山/三",
        "lexicon": "啵",
        "text_free": "那就轻松好多啵！吃三肉。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 34.628,
      "end": 37.665,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "羊肉。中伏啊，天气比较炎热，",
      "score": 0.2857,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3218,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3243,
        "sc_delta": -0.0025,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.31,
        "seg_cer": 0.273,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "样雨，中午啊，天气比较炎热。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 37.665,
      "end": 44.562,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "人们呢容易贪凉，这个时候呢适当的吃点温性的羊肉，有利于散发滞留在体内的寒气，",
      "score": 0.0653,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0114,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0102,
        "sc_delta": 0.0012,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "人们呢，用一坛凉。这个时候呢，适当的吃点温性的洋芋，有利于散发滞留在体内的寒气。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 44.562,
      "end": 46.773,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "疏通经脉。鸡肉，",
      "score": 0.4014,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.572,
        "sc_logprob": -0.5848,
        "sc_delta": -0.0127,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.625,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "疏通经脉，肌肉。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 46.773,
      "end": 50.366,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "鸡肉当中富含大量的蛋白质，非常适合人体的消化。",
      "score": 0.0218,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0003,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0003,
        "sc_delta": 0.0,
